    <string name="pf_faq2_q">Money debited but the transaction failed?</string>
    <string name="pf_faq2_a">Most such amounts return to the customer\'s account within 1–3 working days. If not, raise a complaint with the transaction ID.</string>
    <string name="pf_faq3_q">How do I change my details?</string>
